# Database backups: full mysqldump exports containing every employee record,
# government ID number, and bcrypt password hash in the system.
#
# This directory sits inside htdocs, so without this file Apache serves every
# dump here as a plain download to anyone who can reach the app -- no login,
# no session, no audit trail. backup.php is admin-gated and streams these files
# itself (see backup_stream_record()), which is the only path that should work.
#
# Apache 2.4 syntax. AllowOverride All is set for htdocs in httpd.conf.
Require all denied
